Bind Npc 24435 Zone 1 for karus
Bind Npc 14435 Zone 2 for elmorad
Quest 145 "Orc Talisman"
    Journal for karus "You have promised [Moradon Merchant] Shymer to bring her Orc Talisman."
    Journal for elmorad "You have promised [Moradon Merchant] Clark to bring him the Orc Talisman."
    Collect 7 of 379277000

Requires player level >= 41

Rewards
    Give 2250000 experience

direction_107 = location "Lard Orc" about "Lard Orc\nAn orc race inhabiting Adonis, possesses a relatively low HP but equipped with powerful Attack Power" found "Karus" karus at 410 461 in zone 1
direction_108 = location "Lard Orc" about "Lard Orc\nAn orc race inhabiting Adonis, possesses a relatively low HP but equipped with powerful Attack Power" found "El Morad" elmorad at 1840 1669 in zone 2

On available
    If player is karus
        Say "Master! Did you know that these days Orc Talismans are used for making weapons? Why's that? Would Shaimer know why?"
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Master! Did you know that these days Orc Talismans are used for making weapons? Why's that? Would Clark know why?"
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    Say "Ah~ an Orc Talisman?\nI've heard that Moradon's [Blacksmith] Heppa is always interested in making special weapons. He and I have traded a lot of stuff, and Orc Talismans have always been the most popular."
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "Phew... <selfname> knows too much about me!  It's really quite simple - Orc Talismans are found on Lard Orc's armor. One more thing - Lard Orcs are really ugly.\n\nIf possible, make them high quality Talismans, Ok?"

On in_progress
    If player is karus
        Say "Heppa wants 1,000 of 'em this month, and I'm... hmm... exactly 7 short. Not bad."
        Topic "Where can I find it?" do
            Map direction_107
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Heppa wants 1,000 of 'em this month, and I'm... hmm... exactly 7 short. Not bad."
        Topic "Where can I find it?" do
            Map direction_108

On ready
    If player is karus
        Say "Is this an Orc Talisman? Looks like scrap to me..."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Is this Orc Talisman? Looks like scrap to me..."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On claimable
    Show quest "Ah, so this month's trade with Heppa was a success. Thanks."
